        <article>
            <h2 id="toc-delivery">Delivery</h2>
            <p>Orders placed before 2 pm on a working day leave the warehouse the same day. Orders placed later, or at the weekend, leave on the next working day.</p>
            <p>Every parcel is tracked from the moment it is collected. The tracking link is in the dispatch e-mail and on the order page.</p>
            <h3 id="toc-couriers">Couriers</h3>
            <p>Standard delivery takes two to three working days. Next-day delivery is available on orders placed before 2 pm, to most addresses.</p>
            <p>A courier who finds no one at home leaves a card and tries again the next working day. After a second attempt the parcel goes to the nearest depot for seven days.</p>
            <h3 id="toc-lockers">Parcel lockers</h3>
            <p>A parcel locker holds the order for three days. The code to open it arrives by text message once the parcel is in the locker.</p>
            <p>Lockers take parcels up to 20 kg and 60 cm on the longest side; a larger order is sent by courier instead.</p>
            <h2 id="toc-returns">Returns</h2>
            <p>Anything can be returned within 30 days of delivery, unused and in its original packaging. Start a return from the order page and print the label it gives you.</p>
            <p>Drop the parcel at any courier depot or parcel locker. The return is checked within five working days of arriving at the warehouse.</p>
            <p>Made-to-order items and opened software cannot be returned unless they arrived faulty.</p>
            <h2 id="toc-refunds">Refunds</h2>
            <p>The refund goes back to the card or account the order was paid with, within three working days of the return being checked.</p>
            <p>Delivery charges are refunded when the whole order is returned, or when an item arrived faulty.</p>
        </article>
